All of it is taken from Paseo at commit
b63a325be3d3ae444fbd38815658cca01ab1288f (0.11.2) and changed for ALP:

* server/dist/web-app: Paseo's web app (packages/app), built with the patches
  in ALP's paseo-web/patches. Its NOTICE.txt says what they change,
  LICENSE.paseo.txt is Paseo's licence as Paseo ships it, and
  THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt reproduces the licences of the third-party
  packages bundled into the app.
* server/dist: code from Paseo's daemon (packages/server/src/server), each
  source file in ALP's integrations/paseo/server/paseo saying what changed:
  - agent/chat-search/index.ts (chat-search.ts)
  - agent/timeline-projection.ts (timeline-projection.ts)
  - agent/agent-timeline-store.ts and agent-timeline-store-types.ts
    (timeline-store.ts)
  - relay-transport.ts and websocket/encrypted-relay-socket.ts
    (relay-transport.ts)
  - utils/diff-highlighter.ts, its unified-diff parser (checkout.ts)
* server/dist also bundles Paseo's @getpaseo/protocol and @getpaseo/relay;
  see server/dist/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.
